cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the Zmaj app or its Bosnian dataset, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Zmaj: an open Bosnian course and learning app"
abstract: >-
  Offline app for learning Bosnian (Ijekavian) and the open dataset behind it:
  1,728 words and phrases in 65 levels, 300 cloze sentences, 12 graded reading
  stories with glossary and questions, and 16 grammar lessons, each translated
  into German, English, Turkish, Swedish, Dutch, Norwegian, Danish and French,
  with synthetic Bosnian audio for every item. Code AGPL-3.0-or-later, content
  CC BY-SA 4.0.
authors:
